{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日は\nMステに出演させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/22/9253870/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ぐるぐるカーテン』を\nオリメンで披露させてもらえたので\n出演できたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは舞台だったため\n飛鳥がかわりにセンター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんの所にみさみさ\n飛鳥の所に若が入ってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/22/9253870/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n今回の出演メンバーで唯一の\n初 Mステ であったわけですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、昔にAKB48さんの枠で当たって\n観覧はいったことありますけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出る側として映ったのは\n初めてですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名を歌ってた時は何故か\n家で755をしたような記憶がありますけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は755できませんでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初で最後じゃない事を願うのみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/22/9253870/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと出たい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔のシングルじゃなくてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日にMステに出て\nちょっと遅れて沈金行きたいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっけー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリメンで歌わせてくださって\nありがとうございます、運営さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうの出れるの数年ぶりだから\n緊張するかと思ったけど\n全然 緊張しませんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブリハの毎日だったから\nすごく楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/22/9253870/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん観てくださって\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/22/9253870/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から\nアンダーライブ中国シリーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってきまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}